.Dd November 20, 2026
.Dt BENCH-REPORT.SH 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm bench-report.sh
.Nd run the report llama-bench set on the RTX 5060 Ti with one backend
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm cuda | vulkan
.Ar OUTDIR
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Runs
.Nm llama-bench
for Llama 3.2 3B Q4_K_M (flash attention on), Llama 2 7B Q4_0 (flash attention off and on),
Ornith 1.5 9B Q4_K_M and Qwen2.5 14B Q4_K_M (flash attention on), each with
.Fl ngl No 99
.Fl t No 8
.Fl r No 3
.Fl p No 512
.Fl n No 128
.Fl o No json .
The
.Cm cuda
backend uses
.Xr run-cuda-llama.sh 1 ;
.Cm vulkan
uses
.Pa run-nv-vulkan.sh .
.Pp
.Ar OUTDIR
is created and receives
.Pa BACKEND-MODEL.json ,
.Pa BACKEND-MODEL.err
and
.Pa run.log .
The runs are sequential.
The script refuses to start while
.Pa uvm_stress.sh
is running.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ".Ev GB10_WORK"
.It Ev GB10_WORK
Work root.
The default is the
.Pa work/
directory of the checkout.
.Ev GB10_WORK
overrides it.
.It Ev MODELS
Model directory, for example
.Pa /path/to/models .
.It Ev ONLY
Space-separated subset of
.Cm 3b 7b ornith qwen .
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 when every run succeeded; 1 when a run failed; 2 for a usage error or a running stress test.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr run-cuda-llama.sh 1
